From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:03:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 38/40] Offline model install and rollback for supervisors and
 admins (F17)

A production page, release builds included, that installs a signed
face liveness model bundle zip from removable media and rolls back.
- Home page operational tasks: "Face liveness models", shown only to
  a logged-in supervisor or admin while
  mosip.registration.liveness.model.offlineInstall.enabled is not
  false (asked once). The page shows the version in use, Install model
  bundle and Roll back model bundle (after a confirmation).
- Install: the system file picker (ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT, zip types;
  request code 17 in MainActivity.onActivityResult, no new plugin and
  no storage permission). The picked file is copied to the cache (at
  most 64 MiB + 1 byte), installed with the engine's
  ModelUpdater.installZip (the online update's unpack rules and
  verification, a temporary directory that is always deleted), then
  the analyzer reloads; the copy is deleted. A running session keeps
  its models.
- LivenessServiceHolder: installOfflineBundle, rollbackOfflineBundle,
  modelBundleActionsAllowed, activeModelVersion. Both actions check the
  role and the switch again (fail closed). Outcomes INSTALLED,
  ROLLED_BACK, NOT_NEWER, INVALID (MODEL_INTEGRITY_FAILED),
  NOTHING_TO_ROLL_BACK, NOT_ALLOWED, FAILED; the page shows a generic
  text, never a path or an exception.
- Audit REG-EVT-019 (AndroidAuditSink.modelBundle) with trigger=offline
  or rollback: outcome, errorCode, reason, fromVersion, toVersion,
  durationMs, userId; never a path.
- SessionManager stores is_admin (REGISTRATION_ADMIN) next to
  is_supervisor and clears it on logout; currentUserId for the audit.
- Pigeon: modelBundleActionsAllowed, activeModelVersion,
  installModelBundleFromFile, rollbackModelBundleFromSettings.
- Texts: 15 liveness_model_* keys in the six ARB files (non-English
  machine-translated, marked for native-speaker review). The existing
  liveness_ key-count tests skip the new prefix.
- The debug page is unchanged.

Tests: LivenessOfflineModelInstallTest (7: install and reload with a
bundle signed by a throwaway key, tampered refused, older refused,
zip-slip refused, rollback, role gate, switch off) and
model_bundle_test.dart (6 widget and l10n tests).
With the engine sync before it: module tests 102 (95 + 7), Flutter
liveness tests 90 (84 + 6), all passing; flutter build apk --release
--split-per-abi --target-platform android-arm64 builds (signed with
the debug keystore: there is no release key here).

